WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.056 --> 00:00:03.960
Rain was pouring down.

2
00:00:03.961 --> 00:00:08.878
Nero and Dev were inside, playing charades.

3
00:00:08.879 --> 00:00:15.423
"My turn!" Nero hopped and rolled around the living room.

4
00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:21.220
Dev tapped his chin. "Are you a hot potato?"

5
00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:25.960
Nero's tail wagged. "Yes!"

6
00:00:25.961 --> 00:00:30.130
Dev pumped his fist. "Guessed it!"

7
00:00:30.131 --> 00:00:33.831
Dad stomped in, waving a slipper.

8
00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:38.171
"Someone chewed holes in this!"

9
00:00:38.172 --> 00:00:41.248
Nero gulped.

10
00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:48.419
"And that's not all." Dad led them into the kitchen.

11
00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.193
Mud covered the floor.

12
00:00:51.194 --> 00:00:54.960
Nero hid his face with a paw.

13
00:00:54.961 --> 00:01:00.622
"Oh, um, that was me," Dev said quickly.

14
00:01:00.623 --> 00:01:08.215
Dad pointed to the prints. "Do you have paws, Dev?"

15
00:01:08.216 --> 00:01:13.230
Dev sighed. "No."

16
00:01:13.231 --> 00:01:18.683
"Someone was also eating the trash again," Dad said.

17
00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:21.245
Nero burped.

18
00:01:21.246 --> 00:01:26.920
Dad turned to Dev. "Nero needs training.

19
00:01:26.921 --> 00:01:30.991
He's going to a class at Pam's K9 Academy."

20
00:01:30.992 --> 00:01:33.769
"Dog school!" Nero thought.

21
00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:37.529
"Dev has to sit at a desk all day at school . . .

22
00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.094
I can't do that!"

23
00:01:40.095 --> 00:01:46.512
"But Nero is already trained," Dev said. "Watch this!"

24
00:01:46.513 --> 00:01:50.856
Dev looked at Nero. "Sit!"

25
00:01:50.857 --> 00:01:54.630
"Easy-peasy!" Nero thought.

26
00:01:54.631 --> 00:01:59.262
He lowered his back end to the floor.

27
00:01:59.263 --> 00:02:03.376
But then a bird shot past the window.

28
00:02:03.377 --> 00:02:11.691
Nero charged over. "Woof! Woof!"

29
00:02:11.692 --> 00:02:15.883
Dad frowned and folded his arms.

30
00:02:15.884 --> 00:02:23.736
Dev sighed. "Fine. I'll take Nero to school."

31
00:02:23.737 --> 00:02:28.849
Pam's K9 Academy had a big yard.

32
00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:32.543
It also had lots of toys.

33
00:02:32.544 --> 00:02:37.084
"This doesn't look too bad," Nero thought.

34
00:02:37.085 --> 00:02:40.829
Just then a disk flew past them.

35
00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:44.845
A big dog jumped up and caught the disk.

36
00:02:44.846 --> 00:02:47.849
"Cool!" Dev said.

37
00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:51.250
"Fun!" Nero thought.

38
00:02:51.251 --> 00:02:56.551
Next the big dog zoomed off on a skateboard.

39
00:02:56.552 --> 00:03:02.239
Dev's eyes lit up. "He's amazing!"

40
00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:07.568
"Hmpf!" Nero said. "He's not that amazing."

41
00:03:07.569 --> 00:03:12.351
The big dog did more tricks.

42
00:03:12.352 --> 00:03:17.653
"That dog is incredible!" Dev said.

43
00:03:17.654 --> 00:03:22.985
Nero rolled his eyes. "I bet he can't . . . Dev?"

44
00:03:22.986 --> 00:03:26.337
Nero gasped.

45
00:03:26.338 --> 00:03:32.500
Dev was petting the dog!

